# lib/ holds committed build artifacts; the CI honesty gate
# `git diff --exit-code -- lib/` compares them byte-for-byte against a fresh
# `npm run build`. Pin LF everywhere so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true)
# can never fabricate a diff the build did not produce.
* text=auto eol=lf
lib/** text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
